# Employee Referral Program

## Program Overview
Our employee referral program rewards employees for referring qualified candidates who are hired by NexaTech.

## Referral Bonus Structure

| Role Level | Bonus Amount | Payment Schedule |
|---|---|---|
| Individual Contributor | $2,000 | $1,000 at hire, $1,000 at 6 months |
| Manager | $3,000 | $1,500 at hire, $1,500 at 6 months |
| Director+ | $5,000 | $2,500 at hire, $2,500 at 6 months |

## Eligibility
- Employee must be in good standing
- Referral must be a new hire (not a rehire)
- Employee cannot refer candidates for roles in their direct reporting line
- Referral must stay employed for 6 months for full bonus

## How to Refer
1. Submit referral through Greenhouse ATS
2. Include candidate's resume and your relationship
3. Talent Acquisition team will review and reach out
4. Track status in Greenhouse

